<view class="pad {{large?'big':''}}"><view class="row" style="margin-bottom:24rpx"><view class="title">每一步，都安心。</view><view class="tag">模拟演示</view></view><view wx:if="!online" class="warning">无法连接演示服务，请配置电脑的接口地址。</view><view class="card" wx:if="state && current"><view class="row"><view class="title">今日导诊单</view><view class="muted">A023 · 万穗</view></view><view class="muted">心血管内科 · 钟国医生 · 09:30</view><view class="step current">{{current.title}}</view><view class="hint">{{current.hint}}</view><view wx:if="state.stage === 2" class="hint">前方 {{state.queue}} 人 · 预计 {{state.queue * 3}} 分钟</view><button class="primary" wx:if="current.target && state.stage < 9" bindtap="go">去这里 · 开始导航</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="state.stage < 9" disabled="{{busy || !online || (current.target && !atTask) || (state.stage === 2 && state.queue > 0)}}" bindtap="advance">{{current.action}}</button><button wx:if="state.stage === 2" disabled="{{busy || state.queue === 0}}" bindtap="call">模拟下一位叫号</button><view class="step {{item.active?'current':''}} {{item.done?'done':''}}" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="id">{{item.done?'✓':'○'}}　{{item.title}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="hospital"><view class="title">院内导航</view><input placeholder="搜索 CT、内科、取药…" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" class="step" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pickPoi">{{item.name}}　→</view><view class="row"><picker range="{{floorNames}}" value="{{floorIndex}}" bindchange="floor">{{floorNames[floorIndex]}} ▾</picker><view class="row small">无障碍<switch checked="{{state.accessible}}" bindchange="accessible" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#276bee"/></view></view><view class="map"><canvas canvas-id="floorMap" id="floorMap"/></view><view class="muted">模拟位置：{{locationName}}</view><view wx:if="target"><view wx:if="route"><view class="hint">约 {{route.meters}} 米 · {{route.minutes}} 分钟</view><view class="step" wx:for="{{route.steps}}" wx:key="*this">{{index+1}}. {{item}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="arrive" disabled="{{busy || state.location === target}}">{{state.location === target?'已到达':'模拟到达'}}</button></view><view class="warning" wx:else>当前没有可通行路线，请检查无障碍模式和后台通行设置。</view></view><view class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="scan">扫码定位</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="locate">模拟定位</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view>关怀大字模式</view><switch checked="{{large}}" bindchange="large" color="#276bee"/></view><view class="hint">电脑与手机连接同一个 Wi-Fi，填写电脑局域网接口地址，例如 http://192.168.1.8:3000</view><input value="{{api}}" bindinput="setApi" placeholder="接口地址"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="connect">连接演示服务</button></view><view class="muted">虚构医院与患者 · 无真实医疗服务或支付</view></view>
